From: Bare <git@barebrowser.org>
Date: Wed, 19 Aug 2026 20:32:34 +0000
Subject: Add Bare browser extension settings and features

Port extension settings and features from Bare Browser:
- Mobile-optimized chrome://extensions WebUI with touch-friendly tiles for
  CRX installation, unpacked extensions, updates, and community links
- Mobile responsive layout for extension cards, details, and dialogs
- Bundled uBlock Origin 1.75.0 CRX loaded from APK assets into the profile
  with automatic incognito mode support
- Direct Extensions entry in main Settings
- Manifest V2 extension compatibility

